#: 209c9888d3034284b635dcdbd11913c6
msgid "根据输入参数灵活构建一个线性层、批量归一化和激活函数的组合模块。"
msgstr "Flexibly constructs a combined module of a linear layer, batch normalization, and activation function based on input parameters."

#: e994d93ba0504b86b0ce8d4174692ee7
msgid "该函数根据 `use_batch_norm` 和 `activation` 是否提供，来构造不同组合的模块。"
msgstr "This function constructs different combinations of modules depending on whether `use_batch_norm` and `activation` are provided."

#: 070c037df5754769a1ca584bbcecb39c
msgid ""
"该函数的返回值类型不是固定的。当 `use_batch_norm` 为 `False` 且 `activation` 为 `None` "
"时，它返回一个独立的 `nn.Linear` 模块；在其他所有情况下， 它返回一个 `nn.Sequential` "
"容器。调用者需要注意处理这个差异。"
msgstr ""
"The return type of this function is not fixed. When `use_batch_norm` is `False` and `activation` is `None`, "
"it returns a standalone `nn.Linear` module; in all other cases, it returns an `nn.Sequential` "
"container. The caller needs to be aware of and handle this difference."

#: e36e00044ae24114936d362fb91f6355
msgid "线性层的输入特征维度。"
msgstr "Input feature dimension of the linear layer."

#: b7b3da776c144c48b78abcea16a9a0bc
msgid "线性层的输出特征维度。"
msgstr "Output feature dimension of the linear layer."

#: e002eaca9d7443cbab237df66e67c272
msgid "线性层是否使用偏置。默认为 `False`。"
msgstr "Whether the linear layer uses a bias. Defaults to `False`."

#: 43c78e3372c048a69e2693a369a6b0ca
msgid "要应用的激活函数实例。如果为 `None`，则不添加激活函数。默认为 `None`。"
msgstr "The activation function instance to apply. If `None`, no activation function is added. Defaults to `None`."

#: 1571fc3e94924acc8165efaeb7fc9488
msgid "是否在激活之前应用批量归一化。默认为 `False`。"
msgstr "Whether to apply batch normalization before activation. Defaults to `False`."

#: 20b46990ab9b44c1891e9279c1615bcf
msgid "组建好的 Pytorch 模块。"
msgstr "The constructed PyTorch module."

#: e7e7a642ffae492f917982453b49ffb8
msgid "应用逐元素的 Shifted SoftPlus (SSP) 激活函数。"
msgstr "Applies the element-wise Shifted SoftPlus (SSP) activation function."

#: 404a264045a3402ea9d1d2a2d1337fd6
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"SSP 的计算公式为: "
":math:`\\text{SSP}(x)=\\text{Softplus}(x)-\\text{Softplus}(0)`。 这确保了 "
":math:`\\text{SSP}(0)=0`。"
msgstr ""
"The SSP is computed as: "
":math:`\\text{SSP}(x)=\\text{Softplus}(x)-\\text{Softplus}(0)`. This ensures that "
":math:`\\text{SSP}(0)=0`."

#: f1a6ad95a7c248319f8164c1ab0ad4cd
msgid "Softplus 公式中的 :math:`\\beta` 值。默认为 1。"
msgstr "The :math:`\\beta` value in the Softplus formula. Defaults to 1."

#: e0decb8fdf264642a53fa8b4f156f70b
msgid "当输入值高于此阈值时，Softplus 将退化为线性函数。默认为 20。"
msgstr "When the input value is higher than this threshold, Softplus will degenerate into a linear function. Defaults to 20."

#: f19204aec2c641ddb096cc00e6b675ec
msgid "Shape:"
msgstr "Shape:"

#: 5bb47e3eebe54d5ea87ca731da2b1709
msgid "输入: :math:`(N, *)`，其中 `*` 表示任意数量的附加维度。"
msgstr "Input: :math:`(N, *)`, where `*` means any number of additional dimensions."

#: ea15aa79cea64271a7668a2d3213399c
msgid "输出: :math:`(N, *)`，形状与输入相同。"
msgstr "Output: :math:`(N, *)`, same shape as input."

