msgid "路径存在的条件是，根据群论的耦合规则，`ir_in` 必须包含在 `ir_out1` 和 `ir_out2` 的张量积中。"
msgstr "The condition for a path to exist is that `ir_in` must be included in the tensor product of `ir_out1` and `ir_out2`, according to group theory coupling rules."

#: 4c33b6905d2343be94f7b6dccc269c6e
