msgstr "If the shapes of the input tensors do not match."

#: 96bac29ccce64bb58ad25269a3916a72
msgid "升级给定字典中特定类型张量的精度。"
msgstr "Upgrades the precision of specific types of tensors in a given dictionary."

#: 5957d6f653d44c3d9dace98b1d707283
msgid ""
"该函数遍历字典，将 `torch.float32` 张量转换为 `torch.float64` (double)， 并将 "
"`torch.complex64` 张量转换为 `torch.complex128`。 "
"所有其他类型的张量保持不变。转换过程中会保留张量的原始设备。"
msgstr ""
"This function iterates through the dictionary, converting `torch.float32` tensors to `torch.float64` (double), and "
"`torch.complex64` tensors to `torch.complex128`. "
"All other types of tensors remain unchanged. The original device of the tensor is preserved during the conversion."

#: 1b4accd92c6d46129f078b23caceab1c
msgid "包含 PyTorch 张量的字典。"
msgstr "A dictionary containing PyTorch tensors."

#: 40fd774af5674a968eae94c27418cc64
msgid "该函数直接在原地修改字典。"
msgstr "This function modifies the dictionary in-place."

#: 299dd22dd6d74a018ebb98316402e3f2
msgid "备注"
msgstr "Note"

#: 53a474c9369b487688947ad00066863c
msgid ""
"对于 `float32` 类型的张量，可以使用 `.to(dtype=torch.float64)` 或 `.double()` "
"两种方法来将其转换为 `float64` 类型。为了与复数张量的转换方式保持一致，此函数中使用了 `.to()` 方法。"
msgstr ""
"For `float32` tensors, either `.to(dtype=torch.float64)` or `.double()` can be used to convert them to the `float64` type. "
"To maintain consistency with the conversion method for complex tensors, this function uses the `.to()` method."
